    <li>Account status</li>
    <li>Transaction or withdrawal status</li>
    <li>Dates and times of relevant activities</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>2.4 Withdrawal Information</h3>

  <p>
    If you request a withdrawal, we may ask for information necessary to
    process that withdrawal.
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>Payment account identifier</li>
    <li>Mobile-money account information</li>
    <li>Bank information</li>
    <li>Wallet address</li>
    <li>Other information required by the selected payment provider</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    We only request information reasonably necessary for the selected
    withdrawal method.
  </p>

